multitasking
__
executing multiple task simultansouly is called as multtasking.

it is of 2 types
(1)process based multitasking
(2)thread based multitasking
 
(1)process based multitasking
when program runs called as process.
executing multiple independent program simultamously is called as pocess based multtasking.
example:
writing python program for idle.
online class zoom
downloading file

(2)Thread base multitasking
__
A thread is flow of execution in a program.
single flow of execution means single threaded.

multiple flow if execution  means  multithreaded.
executing multiple independent parts of the same program is called as multthreading.

example:
ms word

spellchecker
auto capitalization


